# Project Context

## Product

Japanese household ledger (家計簿):

- Register **income** / **expense** with amount, date, optional memo, category
- List transactions by date (newest first)
- Edit and delete rows
- **Categories:** 食費, 交通費, 娯楽, 光熱費, 給料, その他 (see `lib/constants/categories.ts`)
- **Monthly summary:** income, expense, net for current month
- **Charts:** category expense pie (current month), monthly expense bar trend

## Auth

- Email + password and Google OAuth (`components/GoogleSignInButton.tsx`)
- Session: `@supabase/ssr`, `proxy.ts` protects `/`; public: `/login`, `/auth/callback`
- Empty memo allowed (app + DB constraint `char_length(description) <= 200`)

## Database (`transactions`)

| Column | Notes |
|--------|--------|
| `user_id` | Required for RLS; set from auth on insert |
| `type` | `income` \| `expense` |
| `amount` | positive numeric |
| `description` | memo; may be empty string |
| `category` | fixed set (CHECK) |
| `transaction_date` | date |

Views: `daily_summary`, `monthly_summary` (security invoker).

## Where to change what

| Change | Primary files |
|--------|-----------------|
| Categories | `lib/constants/categories.ts`, `supabase/schema.sql`, migration |
| Input rules | `lib/transactions/schema.ts` |
| CRUD logic | `app/actions/transactions.ts` |
| Auth | `app/actions/auth.ts`, `lib/auth/schema.ts`, `proxy.ts` |
| Home UI | `app/page.tsx`, `components/*` |
| Aggregations | `lib/transactions/stats.ts` |

## Environment

Local: `.env.local` with `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`. Never commit.
